---
description: Grafana frontend styling — Emotion useStyles2 and @grafana/ui layout
globs: public/app/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend styling

- Style with Emotion via `useStyles2`; do not use inline `style={{}}` or new CSS modules for feature UI.
- Prefer `@grafana/ui` layout (`Stack`, `Box`) over custom flex wrappers when spacing/layout is the only concern.
- Reuse existing `@grafana/ui` components before inventing styled primitives.
- Put `getStyles` at the end of the file; use theme tokens (`theme.spacing`, `theme.colors`, `theme.typography`) instead of hard-coded values.
- Match patterns in neighboring components in the same feature folder.
